#
# uPortal 5.17 schema facts the database metadata cannot tell (rule syntax: RuleSet).
# The generator catalog next to it (generators.tsv) is generated from the entity annotations.
#
# On PostgreSQL, Hibernate 4.3 writes these @Lob String fields as large objects and stores the
# OID, as digits, in a text column (MOD-I24). The copy reads the large object's bytes from a
# PostgreSQL source and writes a new large object (OID in the text column) to a PostgreSQL target.
lob-oid UP_RAW_EVENTS.EVENT_DATA
lob-oid UP_ANALYTICS_EVENTS.EVENT_DATA
